  "deployment_adjustments": [
    "Pinned wheelhouse stays outside the server and project source tree",
    "Capture adapter imports DXcam lazily and emits metadata without persisting pixels",
    "Core capture ports and replay intake do not depend on NumPy or DXcam",
    "Window locator requires exact PID/HWND, foreground state and per-monitor DPI-aware physical coordinates",
    "Capture probes load target identity from versioned authorization and verify the executable SHA-256 before opening the camera"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "DXcam WinRT backend captures a monitor, not a native HWND CreateForWindow target",
    "Continuous TBC 2.4.3 capture and live move/resize are verified; live multi-output migration is unavailable on current single-output hardware and remains fail-closed",
    "Visible desktop capture is unavailable when the WoW client rejects Remote Desktop or is minimized",
    "The pinned wheel set targets CPython 3.14 on Windows x64 and must be refreshed for another runtime"
  ],
